Text("<div style='font-size:18px;color:#CC0000;text-align:center'>$Gingerbread  \\; Man \\; map$\n<div style='font-size:16px;color:#0000FF;text-align:left'>\n$A=(x_0,y_0=(%A[0]% \\,;\\,%A[1]%)$\n$x_{n+1}=1-y_n+|x_n|$\n$y_{n+1}=x_n$\n<div style='color:#FF0000'>\n$(x_{%n%},y_{%n%}) = (%PtFinal[0]% \\, ; \\,%PtFinal[1]%)$",24,229,301,194,"c:rgba(227,178,122,0.18);s:3;r:15;p:4");
